---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/site.config';
import { getActiveGames, getGameUrl } from '@/utils/content';

const games = await getActiveGames();
---

<PageLayout
  title={`About ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`Who writes ${SITE.name}, how the guides are made and kept up to date, and which games we cover.`}
  intro="Game guides written by players, for players."
>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a guide site for the games people are playing right now. We focus on new and fast-moving games,
    where answers are hard to find and change with every patch.
  </p>

  <h2>Who writes the guides</h2>
  <p>
    The guides are written by <strong>Emir</strong>. The ROB RUN guides come from 100+ hours of playing it. For brand-new
    games like GTA 6, guides are researched from gameplay footage and cross-checked across several independent sources
    before they’re published. Everything is written in our own words, never copied from other sites.
  </p>

  <h2>How we keep guides accurate</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every fact is checked in-game or confirmed by at least two independent sources before it’s published.</li>
    <li>Every guide shows the date it was last updated, and the game version it was checked on where it matters.</li>
    <li>When a patch changes something, we update the guide and its date.</li>
    <li>Spotted a mistake? <a href="/contact">Tell us</a> and we’ll fix it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Games we cover</h2>
  {
    games.length > 0 ? (
      <ul>
        {games.map((game) => (
          <li>
            <a href={getGameUrl(game)}>{game.data.name}</a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    ) : (
      <p>The first guides are on the way.</p>
    )
  }

  <h2>Not affiliated</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is an independent fan site. We’re not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any game developer or
    publisher. All game names, images and trademarks belong to their respective owners.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
